WEBVTT

00:04:59.003 --> 00:05:00.671
I just want you to know,

00:05:00.671 --> 00:05:04.425
if there's anyone here in this room
that by being in this project,

00:05:04.425 --> 00:05:07.345
you might offend some
of your victims outside,

00:05:07.345 --> 00:05:08.512
I'm not your guy.

00:05:08.554 --> 00:05:10.806
I'm going to get
too much attention for you.

00:05:11.223 --> 00:05:14.268
If I were you, don't participate
in this project."

00:05:14.727 --> 00:05:17.438
Six or seven guys stood up
and left the room.

00:05:17.438 --> 00:05:18.606
I was like, "Alright."

00:05:18.647 --> 00:05:21.192
So we kept on going
and I started photographing them.

00:05:21.192 --> 00:05:23.986
Very simple, it's just a small
part of the process.

00:05:24.028 --> 00:05:25.488
I'm not really a photographer.

00:05:25.529 --> 00:05:29.075
That’s just one part that I use,
and I get to meet them and talk with them.

00:05:29.075 --> 00:05:31.494
And each of them started
explaining me their story,